  "id": "forest-data-partnership",
  "title": "Forest Data Partnership commodity maps (Source Cooperative mirror)",
  "description": "Per-pixel probability that land is planted with cocoa, coffee, oil palm or rubber, at 10 m, from the Forest Data Partnership community model release 2026a, produced by Google. This mirror holds the West African cocoa belt for 2018, 2024: one collection per commodity and year, 1792 Cloud-Optimized GeoTIFFs copied unchanged from Google's requester-pays bucket and served over plain HTTPS, with pan-tropical overviews for low zoom. Attribution: \"Produced by Google for the Forest Data Partnership.\"",
